# The Social Engineering window (see socialwin.c) opened for faction 2, another faction's models, effects, energy numbers and its own
# values (the box under the effects' buttons: the faction's own effects): the window as it opens, the mouse over the faction's own
# box (what its base values do), a model button, and an effect's button; a click on the effect (every category takes the model
# that brings the most), on Reset, and Return (OK: the same models, no upheaval to pay).
# A place in the window is (111 + x, 203 + y).
# Leave time after each step; the snaps take 2 s each. (Return is also taken by the main screen, which opens the base; the leader's
# portrait there turns slowly, which the mask leaves out.)
